  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Human Rights and Integrity, 2012-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP MR och anti-korruption, 2012-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Iraqi state has more efficient, accountable and participatory governance at national and sub national levels</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r en del av UNDAF 2011-2014 och bidrar till att st&#xe4;rka respekten f&#xf6;r MR genom etableringen av Iraks MR-Kommission, st&#xe4;rkt    samarbete mellan CSOs och MR-kommissionen liksom med parlamentet och skall &#xe4;ven bidra till st&#xe4;rkt ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande genom arbete f&#xf6;r att minska korruption. KRG betalar sj&#xe4;lva f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till sin integrity commission</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of the UNDAF 2011-2014 and aims to strengthen human rights through the establishment of the HR Commission, enhanced cooperation between CSOs the HR Commission and the Council of representatives as well as through supporting more accountable governance including anticorruption. The KRG is financing the         development of its own integrity commission as part of the project</narrative>
  </description>
